Add ahash support to SPAcc driver.
Below are the hash algos supported:
- cmac(aes)
- xcbc(aes)
- cmac(sm4)
- xcbc(sm4)
- hmac(md5)
- md5
- hmac(sha1)
- sha1
- sha224
- sha256
- sha384
- sha512
- hmac(sha224)
- hmac(sha256)
- hmac(sha384)
- hmac(sha512)
- sha3-224
- sha3-256
- sha3-384
- sha3-512

